		<content:encoded><![CDATA[<p>My friend Mahima,<br />
One of the finest people I have known. I still see the smile, feel the hug, know the love of a true friend. </p>
<p>I miss her still. </p>
<p>A loving force was our Mahima. She gathered us round like a brood of chicks, those so fortunate to call her friend.<br />
The world is a better place, I&#8217;m a better person for having known her.</p>
